{
  "assessment": "Ineligible: although the fidelity equation and reported central expectation values are source-supported, the card treats measured expectation values as independently selectable controls and forms their full Cartesian product. The source reports only two paired measurement tuples, one for each Bell state; it does not support the cross-combined domain encoded by the card. Computing fidelity from a source-reported tuple's central values is itself appropriate, but the proposed control semantics and domain are not.",
